{"version":1,"key":"card:386","content":{"id":386,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0493827c-26f8-49fc-bd33-a6db901b6e5c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 React 中，经常我们需要监听某个变量的变化，然后触发一个行为，这个时候我们会使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"useEffect"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，将需要被监听的变量放入它的依赖数组，理想情况是在处理函数中你只使用了该变量，因此只需要将该变量放入到依赖数组中即可，但是实际的情况可能是，在处理函数中你使用到了其它状态，这个时候你不得不把其它状态放入到依赖数组中，否则在处理函数中你得到的这个其它状态可能已经过时了，但是你仅仅只想监听那一个状态，这个时候怎么办呢？"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"tsx","uuid":"902006be-7c3e-4616-9bb1-d4e21a63e246","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"fa836522-c3c9-4e96-b87f-0aa1319f1839","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"useEffect(() => {\n  // 只想监听 state1 的变化，但是为了获得最新的 state2，不得不监听 state2\n  onChange(state1, state2);\n}, [state1, state2]);","collabId":"68f9747f-f733-4f71-9945-3cddd9785b0c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"450cd8eb-5b40-4616-97d7-bc3f68f19af2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有没有什么办法，既可以不把依赖的状态声明在依赖数组中，又可以在调用的时候获取到其最终状态呢？官方提出了一个解决方案，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"useEffectEvent"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"21d92d38-021d-4706-8e02-9baaf04e655c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"你可以将你的处理函数传递给 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"useEffectEvent"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"useEffect"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中仅监听你想监听的状态，当状态发生变化时，执行此函数，即使该函数依赖其它状态且你也没有把这些状态放在依赖数组中，你访问到的仍然是最新的状态。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"tsx","uuid":"b4ca5c92-e0f7-48c7-a5ab-569f60c92271","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b4994b56-f1a0-4c08-840b-caf4af7323d7","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const handler = useEffectEvent((state1) => {\n  onChange(state1, state2);\n});\n\n// 只监听了 state1 的变化，但是在调用 handler 时，仍然可以访问 state2 最新的状态\nuseEffect(() => {\n  handler(state1);\n}, [state1]);","collabId":"2d720363-c3dd-47cd-bb63-6573e8e4cbe5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6ac961e0-ba8d-4c2c-a91a-01c03f80cce9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"useEffectEvent"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 存在种种限制，比如只能在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"useEffect"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中调用，但即使这样也能解决很多的问题，不幸的是，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"useEffectEvent"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个 API 是一个实验性的 API，还没有正式被发布。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"68455691-fae6-4f1a-ae64-00e1452abc70","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"好消息是，有替代品，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ahooks"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"useMemoizedFn"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它的作用类似于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"useCallback"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可以返回一个引用不变的函数，不同的是，它不用声明依赖数组，但是每次调用时访问到的状态都是最新的，所以上面的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"useEffectEvent"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 完美可以被 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"useMemoizedFn"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 平替"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"tsx","uuid":"18b829dc-d170-4de7-b5c1-f34d74b00599","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"dcbfe411-b223-4ebf-b911-3d548fffd5bd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// handler 在组件更新的过程中引用始终不变\n// 但是可以访问最新的状态\nconst handler = useMemoizedFn((state1) => {\n  onChange(state1, state2);\n});\n\nuseEffect(() => {\n  handler(state1);\n}, [state1, handler]);","collabId":"ea78f28d-1006-4af6-9bca-2d3c18b33ac3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8b4da475-dc34-4d1b-b2f5-bef27ca246ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"useMemorizedFn"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的实现非常简单，使用了两个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ref"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，一个用来维护传入函数的引用，保证调用时能访问到最新的状态，一个用来返回，保证返回的函数引用始终是唯一的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"tsx","uuid":"f63bdbdc-84f4-4304-b254-e9ab3c601d8b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"66a30366-c913-4ca3-a546-bb70920eb32f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const useMemorizedFn = (fn) => {\n  const fnRef = useRef();\n  \n  // 传入的 fn 更新时，将其记录在 fnRef 中\n  // 此处 useMemo 不是必须的，因为每次组件更新时 fn 都会更新，这么写没意义\n  // 但是不这么写，在 Redux Dev Tools 有 bug\n  fnRef.current = useMemo(() => fn, [fn]);\n  \n  // 返回的函数的引用\n  const memorizedFn = useRef();\n  // 保证返回的函数的引用始终是唯一的\n  if (!memorizedFn.current) {\n    memorizedFn.current = function(...args) {\n      // 每次调用时访问的都是最新的 fn，因此可以访问到最新的状态\n      return fnRef.current.apply(this, args);\n    }\n  }\n  \n  return memorizedFn.current;\n}","collabId":"cb6a9359-8937-41db-bb14-e03e5548af45","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"866740f3-effc-479a-b382-b06fdb620313","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"7440cca9-a569-473d-b052-175e46256875","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"592944b8-93a0-4fc4-87eb-4199e986924c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"68de4729-06b8-4815-8270-8542b6262288","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://react.dev/learn/separating-events-from-effects","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"05aa2c37-1831-44ce-a883-e19ae9537643","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Separating Events from Effects"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"79c715cb-cccd-493d-ac0e-7b3c221a3637","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"acf014d4-9c56-4a71-812f-cb40ed4831d8","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://ahooks.js.org/hooks/use-memoized-fn","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"9a5b481b-2424-4224-a442-7d9e70dcc829","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"useMemoizedFn文档"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"91bcc9ce-7e24-484a-95ac-a21b097ff06d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0ebd3530-2e78-4107-a6ca-14e091a275d7","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/alibaba/hooks/blob/master/packages/hooks/src/useMemoizedFn/index.ts","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"5b86d71e-07b1-49fc-9ae3-bed27d329bc7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"useMemoizedFn 源码"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["React/useEffect","React/技巧","技巧/React","React/useEffectEvent"],"createTime":1702291742614,"updateTime":1762478138953,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1762478138953}}